      "Language": "bul",
      "Abstract": {"AbstractText": "47 women on which sectio cesarean has been done in occasion of belvic-fetal disproportion, anatomical abnormalities of the pelvis, bad position of presentation. We studies presence of consciousnes spontaneous realtion to pain and possibility for contact according the method of Tunstall M.E. It was proved that the use of benzodiazepin derivate--Dormicum impacts substantially influensences of the studied processes. Introduction anaesthetics (thiopental-kalipsol, dormicum-kalipsol and thiopental and helothan in 0.3%) are reliable protection against the operative stress during sectio cesarean and give adequate anaesthesia until baby is born."},
